{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51482","headline":"试日上主司侍郎 二 · 李郢","name":"试日上主司侍郎 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石帆山下有灵源，修竹茅堂寄此村。\n闭户偶多乡老誉，读书精得圣人言。\n来时已作青云意，试夜忧生白发根。\n十五年余诗弟子，名成岂合在他门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51482.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51482","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}